     "agent": "Purchase Policy §6.2: Parts that come into contact with food (gaskets, lids, body blanks and any other item marked food-contact in the item master) may be bought only from a supplier holding a valid food-grade certificate on file in Bahi. The certificate must be uploaded and checked before the first order is placed. An expired certificate counts as no certificate.\n\nWe cannot order the silicone gaskets from Shakti Seals because they lack a valid food-grade certificate in the system. Do you have their certificate with its reference number and expiry date?",
